give @s written_book[written_book_content={author:"King Abir, Ahsan, Dip, Safwan, Rohit",title:"Hajaribagh Gazette",pages:[{"text": "=== HAJARIBAGH ===\n\nJatio Sangsad of Hajaribagh\n(Kingdom of King Abir)\n\nEdition: v11.0 (2026-10-28)\nSubterranean Megacity Edition\n\nAuthors:\n* King Abir\n* Ahsan\n* Dip\n* Safwan (Goth Hunter)\n* Rohit ATB"}, {"text": "=== EXECUTIVE HIERARCHY ===\n\nKing Abir alone retains supreme sovereign authority.\n\nAll ministers, first lady, and incoming citizens share equal status beneath the King.\n\n* King Abir (Kowsyke)\nPrime Minister & Supreme Ruler\n\n* Ahsane (@sanerar)\nPresident (Rashtrapati)"}, {"text": "=== MINISTRIES ===\n\n* Dip (Moderator)\nMinister of Communication\n(Jogajog Montri, GitHub Ops)\n\n* Safwan (GothHunterJamal)\nMinister of Tourism, Wildlife & Hunting (Explorer)\n\n* Rohit ATB\n(GREAT-RED-DRAGO)\nMinister of Agriculture &\nTannery (Hajaribagh Local)"}, {"text": "=== CITADEL MEGACITY ===\n\nDescend beneath the Ancient Tree at (117, 78, -330) into the 3 tier subterranean utopia:\n\n* Tier 1: Great Treasury (Y: 64)\n* Tier 2: Hivemind Complex (Y: 46..53)\n* Tier 3: Deep Facilities (Y: 36..45)\n\nZero mob spawning with lit vaults throughout."}, {"text": "=== PORTAL NEXUS ===\n\nDimensional Stargate Chamber (Sector 8, Y: 44..53):\n\n* Nether Stargate: 5x7 active portal framed in crying obsidian.\n* End Sanctum: 5x5 ceremonial pool with 12 eyes and active end portal.\n* Amethyst Sanctuary: Tinted glass geode observatory with blooming clusters."}, {"text": "=== HYPERLOOP TRANSIT ===\n\nAutomated Rapid Rail Network (Sector 11, Y: 38):\n\n* Line 1: West to Heavy Ore Refinery\n* Line 2: East to Forbidden Apocrypha\n* Line 3: South to Sovereign Banquet\n\nPress departure stone button to spawn cart and launch immediately."}, {"text": "=== BANQUET & SPA ===\n\nDeep Facilities (Tier 3, Y: 36..45):\n\n* Sovereign Banquet Hall: 18 block feast table, King Abir high throne, dual roaring brick fireplaces, and pantry barrels.\n* Royal Geothermal Spa: Steaming mineral pools, mud brick volcanic sauna, and quartz loungers."}, {"text": "=== WAR ROOM & COMMAND ===\n\nSubterranean Strategic Command (Sector 13, Y: 46..53):\n\n* Underlit tactical map table showing kingdom sectors\n* Upward periscope optical station with spyglass\n* 4 Royal Vanguard sentries in full Netherite\n* Calibrated sculk alert"}, {"text": "=== NETHERITE CRYPT ===\n\nHigh Security Vault\n(Sector 12, Y: 36..44):\n\n* Deepslate reinforced security shell\n* Sculk sensor iron blast door checkpoint\n* Diamond and netherite pyramid with heavy core\n* Crying obsidian arch ribs and wall safes"}, {"text": "=== STORAGE SILO ===\n\nAutomated Sorting Hub\n(Sector 14, Y: 36..45):\n\n* 52 double chest sorting columns (104 chests)\n* Overhead sorting hopper lines and comparators\n* Dual water bubble lifts directly to Armory\n* Central inspection console"}, {"text": "=== FALLING TREES ===\n\nRapid Lumber Harvesting:\nChop the bottom log of any tree with an axe to fell the entire trunk and clear all attached leaves instantly.\n\nBuilder Protection:\nSneak while chopping to disable the tree fall. This lets you harvest or edit individual logs safely when building houses."}, {"text": "=== ARMOR POSES & ARMS ===\n\nLiving Statues:\nArmor stands have arms by default, letting them hold swords, shields, or tools.\n\nPosing Controls:\nSneak and right click any armor stand with an empty hand to cycle through 12 poses. Use them to place royal guards, sentries, and decorations around towns."}, {"text": "=== SMOOTH SLEEPING ===\n\nTime Warp Sleeping:\nWhen a citizen climbs into bed, night accelerates smoothly without requiring every player to sleep.\n\nThe server displays an active sleep bar in chat as night turns to dawn."}, {"text": "=== SATELLITE 3D MAP ===\n\nLive Realm Viewer:\nA live 3D Google Earth map of the entire Kingdom is hosted directly on the server.\n\nAccess:\nOpen in any browser or phone:\nhttp://132.226.135.26:8100\n\nShows live player locations, 3D builds, and terrain in real time."}, {"text": "=== BEDROCK CROSS-PLAY ===\n\nUniversal Access:\nFriends on mobile (iOS and Android), Nintendo Switch, PlayStation, Xbox, and Windows Bedrock edition can now join the realm.\n\nBedrock Port: 19132\nServer IP: 132.226.135.26"}, {"text": "=== GTA RAPID TRANSIT ===\n\nCinematic Sky Travel:\nFast travel across the realm with full GTA style aerial transitions.\n\nCommands:\n* /trigger gtp\nOpens the Transit Menu with one click destinations.\n\n* /trigger tp_base\nSky transit to Base.\n\n* /trigger tp_spawn\nSky transit to Spawn."}, {"text": "=== RADAR MINIMAP ===\n\nSafe Corner Radar:\nType /trigger minimap to receive the Kingdom Radar in your inventory.\n\nYour shields and offhand items remain completely safe. Press [F] to swap the radar into your left hand whenever you wish."}, {"text": "=== TNT ARROWS ===\n\nExplosive Archery:\nEvery citizen can toggle explosive arrows on or off individually.\n\nCommand:\n/trigger tnt_arrow\n\nWhen enabled, all arrows fired from your bow or crossbow explode like TNT on impact with terrain, mobs, or opponents."}, {"text": "=== FROST STRIDERS ===\n\nOcean Ice Walking:\nTraverse oceans and frozen rivers effortlessly on foot.\n\nCommand:\n/trigger kit_boots\n\nEquips Netherite Striders enchanted with Frost Walker II, Protection IV, Unbreaking III, and Mending."}, {"text": "=== ROYAL WINGS ===\n\nSovereign Flight Access:\nEvery citizen can receive max enhanced Elytra and flight propulsion rockets.\n\nCommand:\n/trigger kit_elytra\n\nEquips Wings of the Realm enchanted with Protection IV, Thorns III, Unbreaking III, and Mending, plus a full stack of duration 3 flight rockets."}, {"text": "=== DRAGON SYSTEM ===\n\nRideable & Combat Dragons:\nYou can summon, tame, fly, and fight with your personal Ender Dragon.\n\nTo Summon:\n* Use the Book of Dragons in your inventory, or type:\n/trigger rd_summon\n\nMounting:\nRight click neck with empty hand."}, {"text": "=== DRAGON COMBAT ===\n\nFireball Breath:\nHold an End Crystal while mounted to shoot explosive Dragon Fireballs.\n\nFlight Controls:\n* Look UP to climb\n* Look DOWN to dive\n\nStabling & Quiet:\n* /trigger rd_vanish (Store)\n* /trigger rd_silence (Mute)"}, {"text": "=== MOAR BOSSES ===\n\n7 Elemental Mythic Bosses:\nWitches and Endermen manifest as world bosses with custom health bars and multi-phase magic attacks.\n\n1. Ignis (Nether)\n2. Aquos (Oceans/Rivers)\n3. Terra (Forests/Plains)\n4. Aero (Mountains Y>130)\n5. Voltos (Deserts/Badlands)\n6. Ferrum (Deep Caves Y<0)\n7. Poultry Overlord (Plains)"}, {"text": "=== MORE MOBS (85+ VARIANTS) ===\n\nOver 85 specialized mob variants across all biomes:\n* Desert Mummies\n* Swamp Cultists\n* Skeleton Snipers\n* Nether Legionnaires\n* Drowned Pirates\n\nSpawn with custom gear, heads, and rare drops."}, {"text": "=== CANNABIS FARMING ===\n\n1. Seeds:\nCraft 1 Wheat Seed + 1 Dried Kelp = 2 Cannabis Seeds. Or punch wild ferns.\n\n2. Plant & Grow:\nPlant on hydrated farmland. Bonemeal accelerates growth.\n\n3. Harvest & Cure:\nHarvest raw buds and dry them on a campfire, smoker, or furnace."}, {"text": "=== ROLL & SMOKE ===\n\n4. Roll Joints:\nCraft 1 Cured Bud + 1 Paper = 3 Joints.\n\n5. Smoke:\nRight click or use /trigger smoke to puff animated cannabis smoke rings."}, {"text": "=== SALMAN F RAHMAN ===\n\nGold Tycoon Trophy:\nThe citizen who mines the most gold ore is crowned Salman F Rahman.\n\nPerks & Rewards:\n* Pulsing rainbow glow font\n* Daily random ore at sunrise\n\nCommands:\n* /trigger taxfraud (5s view)"}, {"text": "=== USEFUL COMMANDS ===\n\n* /trigger kit_elytra (Flight Wings)\n* /trigger tnt_arrow (TNT Mode)\n* /trigger kit_boots (Frost Boots)\n* /trigger kit_platinum (Starter Kit)\n* /trigger kit_dev (PM Bundle)\n* /trigger gtp (Transit Menu)\n* /trigger minimap (Radar Map)\n* /trigger guide (This Book)"}]},custom_name='{"text":"✦ Parliamentary Gazette ✦","color":"gold","bold":true,"italic":false}',lore=['{"text":"Edition v11.0: Megacity Edition","color":"yellow","italic":false}','{"text":"Kingdom of King Abir Official Guide","color":"gray","italic":false}']]
